{"title": "Caustic Reprisal", "pageid": 28490, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Caustic_Reprisal", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Caustic Reprisal</b> is a passive feature that retaliates against an attacker that hits the wearer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Whenever a creature deals melee damage to the wearer, that creature takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> Damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\">Fleshmelter Cloak</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Caustic Reprisal</b> only activates if the wearer takes damage. For example when damage is reduced to 0 by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Arcane_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Ward\" title=\"Arcane Ward\">Arcane Ward</a>, Caustic Reprisal does not activate.</li>\n<li>Acid damage from Caustic Reprisal does not activate the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion\" title=\"Ichorous Corrosion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ichorous Corrosion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion\" title=\"Ichorous Corrosion\">Ichorous Corrosion</a> passive on the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Gloves_Leather_2_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Gloves\" title=\"Ichorous Gloves\">Ichorous Gloves</a>.</li>\n<li>Due to the way Baldur's Gate 3 handles its damage calculations, if the attacker lands a critical hit, \"Caustic Reprisal\" damage is doubled from 1d4 to 2d4.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202934\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2026/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17308/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6760/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 970094/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.139      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   51.139      1 -total\n 23.55%   12.041      3 Template:Icon_link\n 23.53%   12.032     23 Template:Trim\n 22.65%   11.584      3 Template:Icon_text\n 21.47%   10.981      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 20.81%   10.642      1 Template:DamageText\n 18.69%    9.557      2 Template:Item_icon\n 18.33%    9.372      1 Template:Damage_type\n 17.48%    8.940      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28490-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202934 and revision id 370208. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}